state/*

# Ngoai le: anh xa topic Telegram. No KHONG phai du lieu chay ma la CAU HINH —
# chin con so nay khong suy ra duoc tu dau ca, va Telegram khong co API nao liet
# ke lai topic cua mot nhom. Mat tep la mat het, phai vao app do tay tung topic.
# Khong chua gi bi mat: chi la so thu tu topic trong nhom rieng.
!state/topics.json
!state/topics.blog.json
!state/topics.dcgr.json

